---
const markers = [
  { stat: '5+', label: 'Years Experience' },
  { stat: '15+', label: 'Countries Visited' },
  { stat: '100%', label: 'Personalized Planning' },
];
---

<section class="guide-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="guide-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="guide-photo-wrap">
          <div class="guide-photo-filigree"></div>
          <img src="/images/dawn-owens.webp" alt="Dawn Owens, Luxury Travel Advisor" width="480" height="600" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Meet Your Guide</p>
        <div class="hairline hairline--left"></div>
        <p class="guide-empathy">Most people who reach out to Dawn aren't looking for more options. They've already found too many. They need someone to look at what's in front of them and say: this is the right choice for you.</p>
        <p class="guide-authority">Dawn Owens has been planning travel for over five years and has visited more than 15 countries across Europe and beyond, not as a tourist checking boxes, but as someone who pays close attention to the details that make a trip feel effortless.</p>
        <div class="guide-markers">
          {markers.map(m => (
            <div>
              <div class="marker-stat">{m.stat}</div>
              <div class="marker-label">{m.label}</div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .guide-section {
    background-color: var(--cream-50);
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }
  .guide-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin-inline: auto;
  }
  .guide-photo-wrap {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    border: 1px solid var(--gold-500);
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .guide-photo-filigree {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--gold-400);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .guide-photo-wrap img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: top;
  }
  .guide-empathy {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-900);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .guide-authority {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--ink-700);
  }
  .guide-markers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--gold-500);
  }
  .marker-stat {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--teal-700);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .marker-label {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--teal-500);
    margin-top: 4px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .guide-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
